{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿勸告以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，你要歸向耶和華－你的上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是因自己的罪孽跌倒了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當歸向耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用言語禱告他說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你除淨罪孽，悅納善行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，我們就把嘴唇的祭代替牛犢獻上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們不向亞述求救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不騎埃及的馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再對我們手所造的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我們的上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為孤兒在你－耶和華那裏得蒙憐憫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華應許以色列新生命"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我必醫治他們背道的病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甘心愛他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的怒氣向他們轉消。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必向以色列如甘露；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必如百合花開放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如黎巴嫩的樹木扎根。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的枝條必延長；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的榮華如橄欖樹；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的香氣如黎巴嫩的香柏樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾住在他蔭下的必歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發旺如五穀，開花如葡萄樹。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的香氣如黎巴嫩的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮必說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與偶像還有甚麼關涉呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我－耶和華回答他，也必顧念他。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我如青翠的松樹；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的果子從我而得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["結束的話"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"誰是智慧人？可以明白這些事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰是通達人？可以知道這一切。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，耶和華的道是正直的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"義人必在其中行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪人卻在其上跌倒。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}